t(1, 700, """The Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: «The Hour will not come until the Romans land at al-A'maq or Dabiq. An army from Medina, of the best people of the earth at that time, will go out to them. When they line up, the Romans will say: Leave us alone with those who were taken captive from us, so we may fight them. The Muslims will say: No, by Allah, we will not leave you alone with our brothers, and they will fight them...» (narrated by Muslim).

With damma on the sin and kasra on the ba (subu minna): ((which is the most correct according to many verifying scholars, such as al-Qadi Iyad and al-Nawawi)); it means that there are groups of the Romans (Europeans or Westerners) who entered Islam willingly, knew the secrets of the Romans and their weak points, and contributed greatly to the leadership of the Muslims' state in a way that hurt the Europeans. So the Romans demand that these be handed over to punish them and make an example of them, and the Muslims refuse to betray their brothers in religion. So the Great Battle breaks out, because the Muslims realize on that day that the European demand is nothing but a "tactic".""")

h(1, 1500, """The state of the end times and the effect of the Roman mind on its leadership""")

t(1, 2190, """At the end of time, not in this time of ours .. The Great Battle will be a European decision whose price will be terrifying until the Day of Resurrection, as Europe will return to what it was before Rome .. a mosaic of villages and small cities .. every city and every village having a king and a sultan whose limit of possession is one street and three alleys!! So why will Europe take this catastrophic decision that will cost it its whole existence, forever?

The truth is that the European decision then, in that future era, will have no relation to Europe today, since in that era we are not talking about Europe in its current form, nor its geopolitical, economic and social nature, nor the secular, materialist, atheistic thought. Nor are we talking about a world resembling today's world, that is, one relatively governed by the remnants of the world order of 1945. Rather we are talking about a completely new world, very different, built on a new construction, but one that is very fast, shocking and sudden; it will not be based on an international consensus where nations sat and agreed on a world order by mutual consent; rather a shocking Middle Eastern power will appear,""")

t(2, 60, """a relative surprise to the East and the West, not a complete surprise, as this rising power will seize vast lands within months, and will possess countless treasures that the world will need: crops, livestock, oil, gas, minerals and international straits, and an enormous human power inhabiting those vast lands. The great powers that ruled the world yesterday will be forced to coexist with the reality of the new world through collective and bilateral international agreements. A short while ago I had a dream about the shift of the collective global weight to the Middle East, and it is understood from the dream that there will be a coming shared international consensus in that future era on shared files. But it is known that there will never be an international consensus on all files.

From here, European policy at that time and in that future era will swing between bowing until the storm of catastrophic weakness caused by a world war passes, and waiting for any opportunity to occupy the Middle East militarily again, as happened in 1917 according to the Sykes-Picot conspiracy.

The Great Battle is the product of European displeasure with the new world, and a permanent, continuous and pressing European desire to regain sovereignty over the world.

The Great Battle is preceded by European provocations against the new states extending over three or four continents, and the title of the greatest provocation is a European revenge for what the new masters of the world did at the beginning of the rise of their power, when they forced the old continent to take back their sons and let them return to their homes. Then the great rich state receives, in the 7 years of the great European distress, the sons of Europe, and Europe demands they be returned and deported back to Europe, but the European demand is refused. The European demand is merely a "tactic" and a desire to regain a dignity they imagined was violated, when they had been forced to return the Middle Easterners to their countries and empty the old continent of them as a condition of cooperation and secure peace. The Europeans thought that this was an insult to them, so after the end of their great 7 years of distress they decide to make the same demand: emptying the Middle Eastern state of Europeans and returning them to their European countries.

This "tactic" is not the real reason for the Europeans launching the Great Battle! The real reason is religious, economic, domineering and imperial.""")

h(2, 1500, """Our last war before coming to the worshipped Lord: the Great Battle""")

t(2, 2145, """At that time the war of the fertile lands would be launched .. But if the weather turns over .. the calculations will be confused .. the dry fertile and the fertile dry .. Then there will be "the seven years of the great distress", which end with a foolish decision .. the Great Battle .. from weakness, hunger and humiliation to defeat, humiliation and the loss of all the land! The end of the old continent forever! Then the descent of the Messiah, peace be upon him, then his death and the death of the rest of the believers .. Then no empires, no kingdoms, and no war between truth and falsehood! Rather, perhaps a war between falsehood and falsehood! Over what? Over desires .. over women .. over gold and silver .. and over everything worldly!

On that day we ask Allah the Exalted that we all, and all our offspring with us, be in the belly of the earth, our souls having all gone forth to their Creator. O Allah, amen""")

h(3, 400, """When the world was collapsing historically every time the cycle was completed, the first thing all humans needed was food, and whoever owned it that day became master""")

t(3, 1020, """Whoever finds that he cannot take in, or that he trembles in fear of falling into the trial of his soul when someone speaks about the issues of the end times, including the main figure in them, must realize that it is not decreed for him to grasp this matter with insight, knowledge and understanding. Then he understands that what suits others does not suit him, because what suits and what does not suit is the pure decree of Allah, and Allah the Exalted's decree is not the same for everyone. What suits half of people suits them because Allah the Exalted wants them to understand that matter outside the devotional state, and what does not suit half of people does not suit them because Allah the Exalted does not want them to understand a matter outside the devotional state.""")

h(3, 1700, """The matter of the end times is a great matter; it is the final stage of the historic battle between truth and falsehood, so 100% of people will not be enabled to understand it!""")

t(3, 2290, """Everyone influenced by materialist thought, especially in the time of the tyranny of the Euro-American influence on the building of the mind, will not understand the reality of what is coming. Some of them rejected it wholesale and in detail, like Adnan Ibrahim, and some thought the matter was Muslim Brothers who will establish a caliphate. Both groups are between a thought that deviated because of the West's influence on the mind and an ignorance of the sciences of the end times, thinking that what is coming is in their own hands; both groups lost their way, and their followers lost their way with them. There remained with us the common people who took from YouTube sheikhs what those sheikhs did not understand about the greatness of the matter of the Hour and its coming. They did not notice dozens and dozens of Qur'anic and hadith texts with sound chains that showed the greatness of the matter of the Hour in the context of what precedes the day of its coming. So they thought, and made people think along with them, that the only great thing in the matter of the Hour""")

t(4, 60, """is only the day of the coming of the Hour itself! And thus the Muslims split, while events have taken them by surprise - not will take them by surprise, but have already taken them by surprise: the materialist Adnan Ibrahim group and those of his kind of thought from Morocco to Jakarta who rallied around him; the group of political Islamists who aspire to something not merely much bigger than them, but as much bigger than them as the size of the heavens compared to a lentil grain; and a third group of common people who memorize without understanding what the channel sheikhs repeat: "This is a matter that should not be thought about at all, otherwise whoever thinks about it falls into trial." So they slept, and thought the end times were 10 thousand years away.

The fact is that the matter will go beyond these 3 groups, to a state of astonishment and thunderbolt, and will be for them like a calamity they never imagined would happen, because the matter will be the shock and the jolt of a whole lifetime for them.""")

h(4, 800, """The end times are the great matter of the Hour. The matter is greater than the minds can bear that think the issue is a movement that will establish such and such!""")

t(4, 1450, """We withdrew from people (I for 44 years), left societies, and left the world to the chatterers, the would-be philosophers, the would-be jurists, the ignorant, the talebearers, the backbiters, and those who commit every kind of evil, from the shameful daily jostling among people, gossip, ill manners and the bad treatment widespread among people, so that we may save our relationship with our Great Lord, our Hereafter and our souls. We said to people: enjoy the world, and "romp" in it as you like, for by Allah we are as uninterested in it as the two races of men and jinn will be uninterested in Hell when they see it with their own eyes on the Day of Calling. And we said to people: this world you see as your paradise, so increase in it every forbidden desire, every evil and every character Allah is not pleased with. For we do not want your way, we do not seek your path, and we do not aspire to share with you what we guard ourselves against of every kind of foolishness that you live in conduct. Then what we fled from came to us, and jumped inside our phones .. it leapt and leapt inside our phones, and they chased us right inside our phones!!""")

h(4, 2200, """The Prophet ﷺ and his family said: Of the excellence of a person's Islam is his leaving what does not concern him""")

h(5, 600, """This world was, and will remain, the world of man; if it is corrupted, none corrupted it but man!""")

t(5, 1345, """I am speaking specifically about the society of men""")

h(5, 1750, """Whoever speaks about what he does not understand brings calamities!""")

h(6, 300, """A man who looks behind him in fear 24 hours a day is a coward!""")

h(6, 1200, """A man who weeps at night over the world has no mind!""")

h(6, 2200, """A man whose concern is the world, the cloak of his dignity is torn!""")

h(7, 800, """A man who chatters about what is of no benefit is dead!""")

h(7, 1900, """A man without wisdom is dead!""")

t(7, 2500, """Devote yourself wholly to Allah, the Great King, then establish complete justice on yourself, and do not busy yourself with establishing it on those around you .. Then do not ask about your mind and the wisdom that will descend into it""")

h(8, 400, """Wisdom is the pearl of the crown of the mind, and without it the crown has no great value!""")

h(8, 1500, """If humans truly wanted Allah and loved Him, they would live on earth as wise people of great understanding!""")

h(8, 2300, """If all humans understood by themselves, Allah would not have sent a prophet nor created a reformer!""")

t(9, 590, """And this emptiness is filled only by Allah the Exalted. Whoever wants to be filled, let him ask for it from Allah alone; and whoever imagines that his "brain" can fill it is ignorant and will die ignorant.""")

h(9, 1000, """The mind, in understanding, is emptiness and nothingness, and in knowledge it is of great craftsmanship!""")

h(9, 2100, """Whoever Allah made understand something, and then thought he was a genius, has been tried and has failed!""")

h(10, 600, """Knowledge is available in books, but understanding is not in books! Understanding is from Allah exclusively and only""")

t(10, 1210, """So the result was the flooding of societies with speakers who, by Allah, are not fit to speak even about the difference between using water and using dates""")

h(10, 1700, """In every age and every land, people have been afflicted with those who imagine they understand certain issues!""")

t(10, 2315, """I am speaking about the society of men""")

h(11, 300, """Among the diseases of the mind is that its owner imagines he understands one of the issues while being among the most ignorant of it!""")

t(11, 855, """I am speaking exclusively about the society of men""")

h(11, 1200, """The adviser who is ignorant of what he speaks about wrongs himself, because his ignorance of what he speaks about would be more hidden if he kept silent!""")

t(11, 1900, """I am speaking exclusively about the society of men""")

h(11, 2300, """Ignorance of something is a deficiency, and it is a shame for one deficient in understanding something to speak about a matter of which he is ignorant and give advice on it!""")

t(12, 470, """I am speaking exclusively about men""")

h(12, 800, """Everything has a disease, and the first of the diseases of the mind is self-admiration!""")

t(12, 1520, """I am speaking exclusively about men""")

h(12, 1900, """The tongue is understanding; it is the ideal reflection of the human mind!""")

t(13, 60, """I am speaking exclusively about men""")

h(13, 400, """In the tongue every story begins and ends!""")

t(13, 1100, """I am speaking exclusively about men""")

h(13, 1600, """Wisdom is salvation, and it does not come with the tongue rushing like a train!""")

t(13, 2200, """I am speaking exclusively about men""")

h(14, 250, """A word is a bullet; you do not know, perhaps a funeral comes after it!""")

t(14, 700, """O Muslims: sometimes, if we do not work in correction like surgeons, the patient does not notice the danger of the disease, and the words pass as if they were something said for entertainment. The mind is a great creation that Allah the Exalted created; it is its right to think sound thinking, not deviant thinking. And the soul is a great creation Allah the Exalted created; no human knows the reality of its righteousness or its trial except its owner. And the relationship with Allah the Exalted is the secret of every person's secrets; no one knows its details except the person himself!

Because of all these truths, it is not right for a person to set himself up as a preacher while he does not understand these truths and is ignorant of them, because he then becomes a bully, an aggressor, committing a sin!

And as much as we are ignorant of the souls of others, and ignorant of others' special relationship with Allah, we must understand the size of the unsuccessful behavior committed by a speaker when he advises ignorantly, preaching to others about what it is not right to preach about at all. So, O people who fall into such errors ignorantly: not everything that crosses a person's mind is spoken about like this, without using the mind, without thinking and without weighing matters.

If a man saw the signs of Allah and kept silent about them, so that someone else was ignorant of what he kept silent about and concealed, this does not make the one ignorant of the thing grasp the outward of what he sees, when what makes him ignorant of the thing has been hidden from him. The analogy of this: when our Prophet ﷺ and his family and the Muslims with him were in Mecca before the Hijra, they all believed that the revelation was true and Islam was true, but those other than them did not know; and when they did not know, they made conjectures, imagined illusions, and their minds thought in errors. And who would accept Abu Jahl advising the Prophet ﷺ and his family not to think about Islam and tawhid, saying to the Prophet: think about the idols?! The mind of Abu Jahl, or of polytheists other than Abu Jahl, could not bear the truth of Islam because of his ignorance and his turning away from listening, so he imagined that the Prophet ﷺ and his family was not successful in what he was doing!

This is a state that happens today, as groups poke their noses into what is bigger than their minds, in issues and matters their minds cannot bear. We as Muslims have been forbidden to tell people what their minds cannot bear, because they will not understand. So would not the one whose mind cannot bear it keep silent, which would be better for him, a tranquility for his soul and a purification of his deeds?!

Today we tell people clear, evident things and their minds cannot bear them; we say: Allah the Exalted said, and they reply: such-and-such scholar said!""")

h(14, 2200, """Saying: "I advise you to think about this and not to think about that" is bad manners""")

t(15, 335, """O Muslims: our Prophet ﷺ and his family guided to right conduct and to sound guidance. When he ﷺ and his family said that the Muslim is the brother of the Muslim, he did not say there are no barriers between the Muslim and the Muslim; it is neither fitting nor right for a stranger to tell a stranger, even if both are Muslims, what is not right between strangers. The brotherhood of Islam absolutely does not mean the removal of the barrier between strangers, so that a stranger transgresses against a person with unwise behavior, thinking that this is the meaning of the hadith "the Muslim is the brother of the Muslim". Islam is a religion of order, a religion of discipline, a religion regulated by values and standards. Unfortunately, today we find dozens of standards have disappeared from the understandings and minds of Muslims, such that matters are wide open for them in their dealings as strangers with Muslims who are strangers to them. So they engage in misguided and unsuccessful behaviors, interfering in a strongly objectionable way in a stranger's life, to the point of interfering by telling the stranger that it is better for him to think this and not think that, to the point of interfering in people's minds and advising them about what they should think and what they should not. And by Allah, it is the strangest of the strange that people dare against people in this way. So correct, may Allah have mercy on you, the concepts, standards and beliefs that affect behavior and make some in society practice unbecoming, unsuccessful behaviors far from the spirit of wisdom and respect. Any person's saying to a person: "Think about this and do not think about that, your thinking about this is not right, and I advise you not to think about that", will remain in my view the highest degree of bad manners.""")

h(15, 1300, """"The Muslim is the brother of the Muslim" never means that the Muslim is fair game for the Muslim""")

t(15, 1975, """So they grew insolent and tyrannical, and thought that glad-tidings dreams are a deed of sonship before Allah the Exalted - exalted is Allah, highly exalted. The Great Lord, holy are His names, has no children to distinguish them from the rest of humanity. If a person sees good in his dream, let him know that it is not a deed of authorization for arrogance, wronging people, lording over them, harming them and treating them badly.""")

h(15, 2350, """Among the worst of people is one who, when given glad tidings of good in his dream, draws inspiration from the saying of the people of Allah's Prophet Hud, peace be upon him, when they said: {and we will not be punished}!!!!!!!!!!!""")

t(16, 590, """And how many perished on this road, sank into the belly of the decrees, and never returned?!""")

h(16, 1000, """O people of dreams, know that you are being tested. How many who received glad tidings grew arrogant! And how many given glad tidings exalted themselves and became tyrannical, or changed and turned fierce! Do not consider them free glad tidings!""")

h(16, 2000, """Is it normal that one of them is, as he says, a "sheikh", and I open an audio recording of his and see a woman in a nightgown in a YouTube ad!""")

t(17, 135, """The devils of the word and the media, who sold their Hereafter for YouTube ads, tremble; and the more a person trembles, the more he says: "Believe me 😀 .. what I say is certain 😀 .. what I tell you is sure 😀"

And of these, whoever calls himself a "sheikh", if we open a recording of his, we inevitably see a YouTube ad with a half-naked woman in it! So we no longer watch any of these, and praise be to Allah, the time of listening to all of them has passed.

Is this called calling to Allah and to the religion? Are naive people supposed to believe that such a person is really successful in what he says while he eats forbidden, ill-gotten wealth?""")

h(17, 900, """The human mind = nothingness before the scheme of Allah the Exalted. I am still amazed at devils who show me an amount of enormous confidence in their words!""")

t(17, 1505, """A dream presented to me for interpretation perhaps 12 years ago or a little more .. two persons of unknown identity, not known by their real names.

Our Great Lord, holy are His names and attributes, exalted in the heavens and the earth, and highly exalted, says:

«O people, an example is presented, so listen to it: those you call upon besides Allah will never create a fly, even if they gathered together for it. And if the fly should steal from them anything, they could not recover it from it. Weak are the pursuer and the pursued».""")

h(17, 2200, """When a fly clung to the name of an unknown person years ago, the statement of the divine challenge came - a dream .. the seer unknown and the one seen in the dream unknown""")

h(18, 700, """Shanghai, Hong Kong, Guangzhou, Shenzhen, New York, Texas, San Francisco, Frankfurt, Milan and Birmingham. The world is ruled from capitals, but development and the strength of nations are not in the capitals!""")

t(18, 1345, """Here is where rights and duties are .. A noble brother asked, saying: perhaps the oppressor, when he oppresses, does not know that he is oppressing! The answer: yes, but he is not excused on the Day of Resurrection for his ignorance of the rights of servants, because he was commanded to learn his religion and did not care, and did not obey his Lord's command to gain understanding in His religion!""")

h(18, 1900, """One ignorant of the jurisprudence of transactions only stands at one of the gates of Hell; I do not say he enters it, but he stands at the gate!""")
